  "description": "KILL SWITCH | Technical Quiz Tech Fusion-2026 | Vaish College of Engineering, Rohtak About the Competition Think fast, answer smart, and prove your technical knowledge! Kill Switch is a competitive quiz designed to test participants' technical awareness, logical reasoning, general knowledge, and ability to perform under pressure. Eligibility and Team Size Engineering category: Eligible engineering and technical students, as defined by the organizers. Management category: BBA, MBA, B.Com and other eligible management students. Team size: 2–3 members. Engineering and Management categories will be conducted separately. Competition Format Round 1: Preliminary Quiz Participants answer 10 multiple-choice questions through the form provided by the organizers. Topics include current technology trends, general awareness, computers, and basic technical concepts. The top 10 teams qualify for the next round. Round 2: Rapid Fire Qualified teams answer a fixed number of questions within a limited time. The top 6 teams advance to the final round. Round 3: Buzzer Round Finalists compete by answering questions using the buzzer. The first team to press the buzzer gets the opportunity to answer. Incorrect answers may attract negative marking. The quizmaster's and judges' decisions are final. Rules Teams must follow the instructions and time limits announced by the organizers. Fair play and honest participation are mandatory. The scoring system and any applicable penalties will be explained before the competition. Test your knowledge, trust your instincts, and activate your Kill Switch!",
