    "details": "<h1>KILL SWITCH | Technical Quiz</h1>\n<p><strong>Tech Fusion-2026 | Vaish College of Engineering, Rohtak</strong></p>\n<h2>About the Competition</h2>\n<p>Think fast, answer smart, and prove your technical knowledge! Kill Switch is a competitive quiz designed to test participants' technical awareness, logical reasoning, general knowledge, and ability to perform under pressure.</p>\n<h2>Eligibility and Team Size</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Engineering category: Eligible engineering and technical students, as defined by the organizers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Management category: BBA, MBA, B.Com and other eligible management students.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Team size: 2&ndash;3 members.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Engineering and Management categories will be conducted separately.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Competition Format</h2>\n<p><strong>Round 1: Preliminary Quiz</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Participants answer 10 multiple-choice questions through the form provided by the organizers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Topics include current technology trends, general awareness, computers, and basic technical concepts.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The top 10 teams qualify for the next round.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Round 2: Rapid Fire</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Qualified teams answer a fixed number of questions within a limited time.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The top 6 teams advance to the final round.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Round 3: Buzzer Round</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Finalists compete by answering questions using the buzzer.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The first team to press the buzzer gets the opportunity to answer.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Incorrect answers may attract negative marking.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The quizmaster's and judges' decisions are final.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Rules</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Teams must follow the instructions and time limits announced by the organizers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fair play and honest participation are mandatory.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The scoring system and any applicable penalties will be explained before the competition.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Test your knowledge, trust your instincts, and activate your Kill Switch!</p>",
